olympus_worker/vendor/good_badminton/court comes unchanged from Good-Badminton
(https://github.com/yo-WASSUP/Good-Badminton, commit 24f2208929f8), which is
under the Apache License 2.0. The licence is beside it.

Nothing from Ultralytics is used. Good-Badminton's shuttlecock detector and its
system.py are left out for that reason, and the check in tests/test_licences.py
fails the build if Ultralytics appears.

Pose uses rtmlib with RTMPose and YOLOX. See Q179 for the open check on the
model weights.
